OL,3,GNEWSAMajor rail disruption after person
OL,4,Ahit by train
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail services between London and
OL,7,FPeterborough were cancelled or delayed
OL,8,Fafter a person was struck by a train.
OL,10,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said
OL,11,Fofficers were called to the line
OL,12,Fbetween Huntingdon in Cambridgeshire
OL,13,Fand Peterborough at about 13:30 GMT. A
OL,14,Fperson was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FRail operators LNER and Thameslink said
OL,18,Fno trains could run between Hitchin in
OL,19,FHertfordshire, and Peterborough, but
OL,20,Fservices resumed from 16:29.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
